{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "f4a4c33b5f1398d4f200e4512645ecf1c67433054f366ad0566495b955fa663b", "ja": "花よりだんご三銃士", "zh": "比起鲜花不如丸子三剑客", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "70272f104744f4c8a858759bf0a52ebad8a757994fc208e37e1f33fba6b8fa9b", "ja": "ファンとアイドルが一緒に楽しむお花見公演\nが実現！　会場には早くからたくさんの人が\n訪れる。気合い十分なのり子、雪歩、静香は\nそれぞれの食べたいものを熱く語りながら、\nさっそく屋台エリアへと向かう。", "zh": "粉丝和偶像一起享受的赏樱公演\n终于实现了！会场里一大早就来了许多人。\n干劲十足的则子、雪步和静香一边热烈谈论着\n各自想吃的东西，一边迫不及待地前往摊位区。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "049f2b25370671d2945f580fc5c77794e6f11e9376a51a42ebfe6f5d2a11cd5b", "ja": "（絶好のお花見日和だ！　開場したばかりだけど、\nたくさんの人が来てくれて、よかったな……！）", "zh": "（真是再适合赏樱不过的好天气！虽然才刚开场，却来了这么多人，真是太好了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a6d6bed2a4569007ade19c5f35275ce1f5054a1f5823f0a12828a329d4ba5f85", "ja": "（アイドルたちも、それぞれ持ち場はあるが、\n自由に花を楽しんでもらうことになっている……）", "zh": "（偶像们虽然各自都有负责的岗位，但也会让她们自由地欣赏樱花……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "1ce2bc88039a75d5bfb402d576cf5e1accd80f361446d3668ddb840b409d2c96", "ja": "我ら！　お花見を満喫したい三銃士！\nここに参上！", "zh": "我们！是想尽情享受赏花的三剑客！\n在此登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "00219ce2cae7a6f7b2a31e8c788687421afbde275cb0625fbab6ccb0fd963e8e", "ja": "お、おお……のり子、雪歩、静香。\n3人とも、一際気合いが入ってるみたいで頼もしいな！", "zh": "哦、哦哦……德子、雪步、静香。  \n你们3人看起来都格外干劲十足，真让人放心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cad6ea7ccf09bb8d28687a406f1a2dcec40cc8fc3b4108b5ea1e5d2647d86e64", "ja": "わ、私達、お花見を楽しむことにかけては貪欲ですぅ！\nお客さんと一緒に、思いきり楽しみたいと思います。", "zh": "我、我们可是很贪心地想尽情享受赏花呢！  \n想和客人们一起，痛痛快快地玩个尽兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "394bb3f593211a07f489e1ce904e0f1dd02f7d8da2ec56c94c904f1e55c38606", "ja": "そうですね！　……まあ、私はどちらかというと\nストッパーとして、お二人についていくだけですけど。", "zh": "是啊！……不过，真要说的话，我更像是负责踩刹车，只是跟在你们两位后面而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d8cc32d5fef3541d81ae633dfe2c83b34009f1ca25b5985573124a6eaf0b8a7", "ja": "（なんだかんだいって、静香も楽しそうだな……）", "zh": "（说到底，静香看起来也玩得挺开心的嘛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0d4fd4aac30c8bf6e8bee71f169946b69b7d22dbeb440521b5e15780969ef40", "ja": "のり子さん、雪歩さん、最後にライブがあること、\nくれぐれも忘れないでくださいね。", "zh": "德莉子小姐、雪步小姐，请千万别忘了最后还有演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "57c40a4499de6658232c3992dcef7b0a179ac9180160db16d7b89383f89838ea", "ja": "わかってるって！　それより……まずは何食べよっか？\nアタシ……炭火焼きのお肉、気になってたんだよね♪", "zh": "知道啦！　比起这个……我们先吃什么好呢？\n我啊……一直很在意炭火烤肉来着♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9e2f93fe287ccbd45d8391fa1497b39d9f46ae6889c92c331e2894c6366e0cf7", "ja": "私は、三色のかわいいお花見団子が気になります。\nお茶に合いそうだし、少し多めに買おうかなって。", "zh": "我对三色的可爱赏花团子很感兴趣。\n感觉很适合配茶，要不要多买一点呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc56d2a147701f2a7e94ae2ea100206c9e8f74582ed53a56eaf5470a8a78bf76", "ja": "食べすぎて、ライブ中にお腹が痛くなったら大変です。\nだから私は……うどんの方がいいと思います！", "zh": "要是吃太多，演出时肚子疼就糟糕了。所以我……还是觉得乌冬面比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f604d9aa38888f7b2270523a6c7319d2a3d1c5267c310cd9851e52c5e405ed41", "ja": "それなら……。", "zh": "那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee485feef63e9fa04bfccb57a549e3f5df470acdd033a18b1b3eaafae6618fca", "ja": "みんなの希望はわかった！　せっかくのお花見だもん。\n全部食べちゃおうっ！　ほらほら、行くよー！", "zh": "我明白大家的愿望了！难得来赏花嘛。  \n把这些全都吃掉吧！来来，出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "1f509e6205b258b30fcfe797d0fb69898f38ed46d8bb2fd86a8704b4138203a5", "ja": "食べすぎないようにって話だったような……。\nのり子さん！　話、聞いてました！？", "zh": "刚才说的不是要注意别吃太多吗……\n纪子小姐！您有在听吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_01_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "88ee6af60af6eefc79c3e1584ea1389e13b91f080f4fdb57c8aafaaf6b138d91", "ja": "あっ。たしか琴葉ちゃんが「胃薬を持ってる」って。\n私、念のためにもらってきますぅ～！", "zh": "啊。我记得琴叶好像说过“带了胃药”。\n我以防万一去拿一点过来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
